sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as 平台管理员
    participant UI as Admin
    participant API as frontend/src/api.ts
    participant Sec as SecurityConfig
    participant Ctrl as ApiControllers
    participant Dashboard as AdminDashboardService
    participant Store as DemoStore
    participant Actuator as Actuator
    Admin->>UI: 打开运营看板
    UI->>API: GET /admin/metrics
    API->>Sec: 携带管理员 Token
    Sec->>Ctrl: 校验 PLATFORM_ADMIN
    Ctrl->>Dashboard: metrics()
    Dashboard->>Store: 聚合用户、商家、订单、评价和日志
    Store-->>Dashboard: metrics DTO
    Dashboard-->>UI: KPI、分布、趋势、排行和日志
    UI->>API: GET /actuator/health
    API->>Actuator: 查询健康状态
    Actuator-->>UI: UP 或异常状态
    alt 角色不符或 Token 无效
        Sec-->>UI: 403/401
    else 空数据或健康异常
        Dashboard-->>UI: 零值/空态；显示可理解错误
    end
